findings.current_text:
- **What Embodied adds after 2031.** Robots pull these earlier or make them more likely by 2035:
  - ten million robots, from late 2032;
  - robots on flight hardware across the supplier base, 2033;
  - qualification campaigns 30% shorter at leading firms, 2033 (High by 2035);
  - the flight-software verification calendar halved, 2033;
  - a new large engine in four years, 2033;
  - a hundred robots on the Moon at once (Medium);
  - leading firms halving development cycles, 2034 (Medium).
